data: {"id": "ae718e2b245e4fc8-thinking-parallel_evidence-2555", "run_id": "ae718e2b245e4fc8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 采集事实、冲突与缺口\n\n### 已确认的事实\n\n1. **Pod 身份与状态**：`aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4` 当前 STATUS 为 **ImagePullBackOff**，AGE 约 61 分钟，RESTARTS=0，READY=0/1。Controlled by ReplicaSet `workload-65b7f54794`。\n\n2. **根因直接原因（来自 kubectl describe 事件）**：\n   - kubelet 在 60m 前（首次）到当前持续报 `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"`。\n   - 底层错误是 DNS 解析失败：`lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host`。\n   - `registry.invalid` 是一个故意无效的 registry 域名，DNS 无法解析，导致无法拉取镜像。\n\n3. **事件序列**：\n   - `E", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788413634325, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

